  "body": "Brand New | Freehold | Peaceful Cul-de-Sac | Premier Rangi Zone\r\n\r\nWelcome to a stylish, low-maintenance retreat where peaceful coastal living meets the vibrant energy of Browns Bay. Tucked away in a quiet, family-friendly cul-de-sac, this brand-new residence offers exceptional space, flexibility, and light-filled comfort tailored for modern lifestyles.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n* Open plan kitchen, dining and living \r\n* Flexible & Generous Layout: 2 spacious bedrooms, a dedicated home study, plus a versatile multi-function room (perfect as a 3rd bedroom, media space, or secondary lounge).\r\n* 3.5 Bathrooms: Maximum convenience with 1 private ensuite bathrooms plus 2 full family bathrooms and guest toilet -no morning rush hour here!\r\n\r\nElite Dual-Zone Schooling\r\nInvest in your family's future with access to some of the North Shore's top-rated schools:\r\n* Sherwood School\r\n* Northcross Intermediate & Murrays Bay Intermediate\r\n* Rangitoto College & Long Bay College\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Coastal Lifestyle\r\nEnjoy the best of the Bays right at your doorstep. Take a short stroll to the golden sands of Browns Bay Beach, stretch your legs at Freyberg Park and Sherwood Reserve, or grab a coffee at local cafes in the bustling town centre. Commuting is seamless with effortless public transport connections and easy access to Westfield Albany and the CBD.\r\n\r\nCCC and Title issued. Don't miss your chance to secure this home in a high-demand coastal location.\r\n\r\nCall us today to schedule a private viewing or join us at our upcoming Open Home!",
